    "section_accordions_FtX3xn": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_zJBeLi": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long will my JanSport order take to arrive including processing and shipping?",
            "content": "<p>We make the best effort to process orders within one business day. For an estimate of shipping times, please reference the times below:</p><p>Shipping and Delivery days for all methods of shipping are Monday – Friday, excluding federal holidays. If your order is completed before 9am (CT) it will be shipped the same day. Orders placed after 9am (CT) will ship the next shipping day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_XeeDBP": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I know when my JanSport order ships?",
            "content": "<p>When your order ships, you’ll receive an email confirmation with the tracking number(s) and estimated delivery date(s). You can also <a href=\"https://www.jansport.com/shop/LogonForm?langId=-1&storeId=7201&pageName=orderlookup\">Track Your Order</a> to see all order updates.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_gHWBDJ": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I track my JanSport order?",
            "content": "<p>When an order is shipped, we’ll update your account to show the tracking number(s) for an order, and send you an email with the shipping and tracking information. Using the tracking number(s) provided, you can either click on the tracking numbers themselves or enter the tracking number(s) into the chosen carrier’s website (FedEx or USPS) to follow the path of your order from our warehouse to your destination. You can also <a href=\"https://www.jansport.com/shop/LogonForm?langId=-1&storeId=7201&pageName=orderlookup\">Track Your Order</a> to see all order updates.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_k3FP9G": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does JanSport have flat rate shipping?",
            "content": "<p>Yes - JanSport.com charges a $5 flat fee for standard shipping on all orders $49.99 and under.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_ciBy9a": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What methods of payment does JanSport.com accept?",
            "content": "<p>JanSport.com accepts several forms of payments for your shopping convenience, including both domestic and international versions of the below cards:</p><ul><li>Visa</li><li>MasterCard</li><li>Discover</li><li>American Express</li></ul><p>Debit cards with a Visa or MasterCard logo are also accepted</p><ul><li>Apple Pay</li><li>Klarna</li><li>PayPal</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_zb6wgE": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The address I typed is correct, but JanSport.com is not accepting it. What should I do?",
            "content": "<p>Does the address you typed match the address on file with the credit card company? If you still encounter a problem after you’ve verified that the address matches, please call our Customer Center at 1-855-818-5966 for further assistance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_aQaEe8": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What do I do if my promotion code/coupon code doesn’t work?",
            "content": "<p>Verify that you entered the promotion code number exactly as shown, without spaces and using the correct capitalization. If problems persist, please refer to the terms and conditions associated with the promotion code.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_k43mgU": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I get a price adjustment for items now on sale?",
            "content": "<p>Online price adjustments can be made within 1 week of the original purchase</p><p>*No price adjustments on Black Friday or Cyber Monday deals</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_4iiGCi": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why does my credit card or debit card show two charges?",
            "content": "<p>Sometimes credit/debit card statements contain two transactions, but this is only a temporary scenario. When a purchase is made, an authorization charge is placed on credit/debit cards which temporarily hold funds on an account. This is not actually a charge on your card. Once the order has been shipped, this authorization becomes an approval and charges your account. The authorization is released at a maximum of 72 hours from the time of order. </p><p>For your own protection and security, JanSport.com may pre-authorize $1 to verify your billing address and credit/debit card information. Upon successful pre-authorization, we’ll authorize the full amount of your purchase (plus any applicable sales tax and shipping fees). If this $1 pre-authorization fails, JanSport.com will not authorize the full amount of your purchase. This $1 pre-authorization will drop off from your account within 2-3 business days (depending on your financial institution). We will collect payment or charge your debit/credit card only when the order is shipped.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_qwaAA9": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is sales tax calculated?",
            "content": "<p>Taxes that appear on your online order are approximate. The actual taxes charged to your credit card will reflect the applicable state and local sales tax, and will be calculated when your order is shipped.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_ggaTn9": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I get in touch with JanSport customer service?",
            "content": "<p>Please contact <a href=\"https://www.jansport.com/customer-service/contact-us.html\">JanSport customer service</a> with any questions or concerns.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_xpYGtV": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is JanSport's return policy?",
            "content": "<p>Learn more about the JanSport.com<a href=\"https://www.jansport.com/my-account/returns.html\">return policy.</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_W6LQCp": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to cancel a JanSport order?",
            "content": "<p>To cancel a JanSport order, please contact <a href=\"https://www.jansport.com/customer-service/contact-us.html\">customer service.</a></p>"
          }
        }
      },
