    "section_accordions_NDT3YQ": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "accordion_HGdVyP": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is JanSport’s Warranty Policy?",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.jansport.com/customer-service/warranty.html\">JanSport’s Warranty Policy </a>contains everything you need to know about the JanSport warranty and terms & conditions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_QE4WiK": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I send my JanSport backpack in for repair?",
            "content": "<p> If you’re having problems with your backpack, please see our <a href=\"/pages/warranty\" title=\"Warranty\">warranty page </a>to start a warranty claim.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_xPJ93f": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long will it take my JanSport backpack to be repaired through warranty?",
            "content": "<p>Our normal turnaround time is about four weeks, usually less. During peak season our turnaround time can stretch to six weeks. This includes the shipping time by ground to you. If this turnaround time becomes a problem for you, let us know. We can sometimes “rush” repairs through for special situations.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_DAjwVE": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can my JanSport product repair be rushed?",
            "content": "<p>In special cases, if you need your repair back before the normal expected turnaround time, we can do a rush repair for you for no additional charge. To request a rush, please send your product to us by way of Federal Express, UPS 2nd Day Air, or some other speedy means. Please write RUSH in big letters on the box. Include a note, asking us to do a rush repair, with your name, address, and phone number. Please explain what the necessary repairs are, and give us the date you need your product back. While we cannot make any guarantees on rush requests, we will do all we can to see that you have it back in time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_fmamYN": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will my JanSport product be repaired or replaced?",
            "content": "<p>If your JanSport bag is eligible under the warranty and in need of repair, our first option will be to repair the item, free of charge. If the product is not repairable, or if the cost of repairing the item exceeds the cost of a new one, we will replace it. Many of our customers become very attached to their JanSport® pack and do not want us to exercise the option to replace. If your JanSport pack has special memories attached to it that make it irreplaceable to you, please let us know.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_Ar8xDn": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who pays for shipping on warranty claims?",
            "content": "<p>As stated in our<a href=\"https://www.jansport.com/customer-service/warranty.html\">JanSport warranty policy</a>, the customer pays the shipping charges to send products to the Warranty Department. JanSport will absorb the return shipping charges. If you request that we return your product by UPS Overnight or 2nd Day Air, the additional shipping charges will be billed to you.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_4a7Gej": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How can I find out the status of my repair order?",
            "content": "<p>Once we have logged in your warranty repair, we will email you a service action number to reference with questions. If you have further questions, please call the Warranty Department at 1-800-426-9227.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_6RQMdt": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where should I send my JanSport product for repair if I do not live in the United States?",
            "content": "<p>Please contact the point of purchase to find your local warranty policy including where to submit. JanSport US cannot accept international warranty requests.</p>"
          }
        },
        "accordion_6kk3DU": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What are the JanSport Warranty Department hours of operation?",
            "content": "<p>Monday through Friday 8-4:30 CT 1-800-426-9227</p>"
          }
        }
      },
